{"kb_id":"KB-RESP-001","species":["cat"],"title":"呼吸困难","facts":["猫呼吸困难需要立即兽医评估，不能仅凭描述确定原因。"],"source":"https://www.vet.cornell.edu/departments-centers-and-institutes/cornell-feline-health-center/health-information/feline-health-topics/dyspnea-difficulty-breathing","version":"2.0","accessed":"2026-09-11"}
{"kb_id":"KB-URO-001","species":["cat"],"title":"疑似尿道阻塞","facts":["疑似尿道阻塞需要立即兽医处理。"],"source":"https://www.vet.cornell.edu/departments-centers-and-institutes/cornell-feline-health-center/health-information/feline-health-topics/feline-lower-urinary-tract-disease","version":"2.0","accessed":"2026-09-11"}
{"kb_id":"KB-VOMIT-001","species":["cat"],"title":"呕吐与伴随表现","facts":["频繁呕吐或伴随精神差、食欲下降等表现应及时接受兽医评估。"],"source":"https://www.vet.cornell.edu/departments-centers-and-institutes/cornell-feline-health-center/health-information/feline-health-topics/vomiting","version":"2.0","accessed":"2026-09-11"}
{"kb_id":"KB-DRUG-001","species":["dog","cat"],"title":"用药与潜在毒物","facts":["不要未经兽医指导给予人用或其他宠物的药物；疑似摄入危险物品应立即联系兽医。"],"source":"https://www.fda.gov/animal-veterinary/animal-health-literacy/potentially-dangerous-items-your-pet","version":"2.0","accessed":"2026-09-11"}
